1
00:00:07,641 --> 00:00:08,291
Help!

2
00:00:08,991 --> 00:00:10,641
Are we supposed to go to the Control Room?

3
00:00:11,041 --> 00:00:11,991
No way.

4
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:13,591
They're calling for help.

5
00:00:17,091 --> 00:00:18,341
I think we should go save them.

6
00:00:18,341 --> 00:00:19,566
Let's rescue them.

7
00:00:19,566 --> 00:00:20,141
Let's go.

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,630
Am I bringing my mascot out with me?

9
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:25,480
Ah!

10
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,630
That scared me!

11
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,460
Sis!

12
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,430
Is that an NPC?

13
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,930
Is he going to interact with me?

14
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,830
Why is the NPC stuck?

15
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,970
There's key evidence here!

16
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:51,195
"Key evidence must never be discovered." EP 09...

17
00:00:51,195 --> 00:00:52,370
I saw your gun.

18
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,120
What's going on?

19
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:57,770
Why are the NPCs and cameramen all frozen?

20
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,120
Time is rewinding!

21
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,120
Right?

22
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,150
That last one ended up right here...

23
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:06,600
Does this zombie have clues on him?

24
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:12,550
Here, here, here, here, here!

25
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:13,200
Is he...

26
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:16,750
It's an arrow!

27
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:29,630
Whoa!

28
00:01:29,930 --> 00:01:39,380
Okay, okay.

29
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,970
It really is the Control Room.

30
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:44,420
It really is!

31
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,770
So you guys were right here.

32
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:49,320
You're the ones who set the AC to five degrees!

33
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:51,470
This isn't the AC room.

34
00:01:51,570 --> 00:01:53,020
You weren't the ones controlling the AC.

35
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:56,370
Why is someone tracking our faces?

36
00:01:56,370 --> 00:01:56,870
And...

37
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:58,720
I'm still on a fixed camera.

38
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:41,090
This is my PD!

39
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,890
What does that mean?

40
00:02:46,490 --> 00:02:46,765
Hey!

41
00:02:46,765 --> 00:02:48,040
Hold on a sec.

42
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:51,440
What-what-what is this thing?

43
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:54,190
Look, what does "don't press together" mean?

44
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:54,940
I'm gonna press it anyway!

45
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:55,815
"Don't press together."

46
00:02:55,815 --> 00:02:56,890
Then let's press them together!

47
00:02:56,940 --> 00:02:59,190
Come on. One...

48
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:00,580
Two, three!

49
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:03,270
Whoa, whoa!

50
00:03:14,830 --> 00:03:17,030
Great job, everyone!

51
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:21,090
You startled me.

52
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:23,390
Happy wrap!

53
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:26,165
Happy wrap!

54
00:03:26,165 --> 00:03:32,440
This is their daily script, Succession War First Draft: How to Hide Key Evidence.

55
00:03:32,690 --> 00:03:34,065
The best way is to hide it.

56
00:03:34,065 --> 00:03:35,340
Hide it somewhere.

57
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:36,790
As long as no one can find it.

58
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,690
Come here, come here.

59
00:03:41,690 --> 00:03:42,890
Not in the same spot.

60
00:03:42,890 --> 00:03:44,065
It gets easier the second time.

61
00:03:44,065 --> 00:03:45,265
You can hide it in wall cracks.

62
00:03:45,265 --> 00:03:46,440
Or under the bed.

63
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,065
Okay, okay.

64
00:03:48,065 --> 00:03:48,990
I got it.

65
00:03:48,990 --> 00:03:49,940
I'm taking this one with me.

66
00:03:50,390 --> 00:03:52,040
I'll study it carefully.

67
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,390
Alright.

68
00:03:54,390 --> 00:03:54,890
Great job.

69
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,920
Great job, great job.

70
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,120
Thanks, everyone.

71
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,760
Happy wrap!

72
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,960
Thank you.

73
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,560
Ah.

74
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,310
Good job.

75
00:04:02,310 --> 00:04:02,685
Good job.

76
00:04:02,685 --> 00:04:03,110
Thank you.
